Upstream-Name: coaxhub-stationd
Upstream-Contact: CoaxHub <packages@@COAXHUB_DOMAIN@>
Source: https://github.com/CoaxHub/stationd
Comment:
 This package bundles ka9q-radio's radiod, built from commit
 @KA9Q_COMMIT@
 of https://github.com/ka9q/ka9q-radio (radiod, rtlsdr.so and presets.conf
 under /usr/lib/coaxhub/radiod/). The corresponding source is published next
 to this package in the CoaxHub APT repository as
 ka9q-radio-@KA9Q_SHORT@.tar.gz (SHA-256 @KA9Q_TARBALL_SHA256@),
 and the scripts that build it are in the CoaxHub/stationd repository
 (packaging/). radiod was built with ARCHOPTS "@ARCHOPTS@".

